<title>FINLAND: INTERBANK SEES GOOD TREND IN OP EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>INTERBANK SEES GOOD TREND IN OP EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Interbank said on Friday that operating earnings would develop favourably this year, after its first half operating profit rose to 6.1 million markka from 1.7 million, exceeding last year's total 4.5 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The 1997 operating profit is expected to develop favourably,&quot; the bank said in a statement with its January-June interim report.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 242, news@reuters.fi</p>
